---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout {...{"title": "Camp Safety | Hide and Seek Day Camp", "description": "Parents leave their children with us so they can go to work. Here is exactly how we screen and train the people who spend the day with your camper.", "path": "/parent-info/safety/", "banner": {"img": "/img/summer-05.webp", "alt": "Camper in a helmet climbing up to the zipline", "eyebrow": "Parent Info", "title": "Safety", "intro": "Parents leave their children with us so they can go to work. Here is exactly how we screen and train the people who spend the day with your camper.", "h1": "title", "crumb": {"href": "/parent-info/", "label": "Parent Info"}}}}>
  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap g2">
    <div class="card"><h2 class="h3">Background checks</h2><p class="s">Every Hide and Seek employee receives a background check before the summer begins.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h2 class="h3">References</h2><p class="s">All employees provide several references and complete counselor training.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h2 class="h3">Ropes course training</h2><p class="s">Staff are trained on the ropes course by a certified third party before camp starts, and several are certified operators.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h2 class="h3">CPR and first aid</h2><p class="s">Camp directors are CPR and first aid trained.</p></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="tint" style="padding:88px clamp(20px,3vw,40px)"><div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:32px">Day to day</h2>
    <div class="g3">
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">Small groups</h3><p class="s">Campers stay with one group and one counselor all week.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">Carpool</h3><p class="s">Named pick up authorization at every campus.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">Weather</h3><p class="s">Indoor space at all three campuses and a rainy day drop off plan.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap g3">
    <div class="ph" style="height:260px"><img src="/img/involved-03.webp" alt="Group of staff together outside"></div>
    <div class="ph" style="height:260px"><img src="/img/gallery-dsc00338.webp" alt="Camper in a harness climbing in the trees"></div>
    <div class="ph" style="height:260px"><img src="/img/week-01.webp" alt="Counselors with a group of campers" style="object-position:50% 40%"></div>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
